<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 27.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 27.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Friday, June 27:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,711.60 (1,693.80)	CHF  1,189.90 (1,176.60)</p>
<p>    DEM    990.62 (983.00)	  GBP  2,851.50 (2,821.50)</p>
<p>    ATS    140.77 (139.69)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Thursday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $39.77 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$29.09 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $68.86 million ($42.91 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
